- @title = 'AWS Activate · Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'light'
- @body_id = 'awsactivate'

.page
  .page-hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'pricing' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | AWS Activate
        h3
          | Collaboratively develop powerful web applications within any modern web browser

  article.featurette
    .container
			h2
				| Self Starter: 3-months free of our "Plus" Individual Plan (a $240 value)

			p
				| The AWS Activate self-starter package is perfect for the individual professional who wants to develop within isolated, replicable environments from any modern web browser. Individual plans include:

			ul
				li Increased performance on a powerful cloud hosted VM
				li Instant Provisioning - Sign Up and Start Coding in the cloud 30 seconds in Ruby/Rails, Python/Django, NodeJS or Go.
				li Intuitive Web IDE - Work from any modern web browser
				li Native App Integration - Use you favorite text editor when you're on your home computer.
				li Shareable Dev Environments - Easily pair program with up to 1 additional colleagues to enable Front End Developers & Designers to access development backend services.
				li Live Preview - Get immediate feedback from colleagues and clients with shareable "staging" urls.

			h2
				| Portfolio: 3-months free of our Organization Plan for up to 3 users (a $900 value)

			p
				| The AWS Activate portfolio package is a powerful collaborative development environment for teams. The AWS Portfolio package includes:

			ul
				li A dedicated cloud hosted VM for each developer
				li Private organization snapshotting -- snapshot and share environments with teammates
				li Intuitive Web IDE - Work from any modern web browser
				li Native App Integration - Use you favorite text editor when you're on your home computer.
				li Shareable Dev Environments - Easily pair program with unlimited teammates within your organization to enable Front End Developers & Designers to access development backend services.
				li Live Preview - Get immediate feedback from colleagues and clients with shareable "staging" urls.

			a href='http://aws.amazon.com/activate/benefits/special-offers/appdev/' Read more about applying

= render partial: 'layouts/footer', locals: { active: 'vpc' }